<title>SOUTH KOREA: Korea Fine says gets U.S. FDA approval.</title>
<headline>Korea Fine says gets U.S. FDA approval.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Korea Fine Chemical Co Ltd said on Monday it had received approval from the U.S. Food and Drug Administration (FDA) to source OONE, a key intermediate for the synthesis of the arnoxapine drug substance.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that the FDA inspected Korea Fine's plant in January.</p>
<p>Korea Fine said it would invest $2 million this year to modernise research and development facilities and more than $10 million over the next three years to expand capacity of its multi-purpose plant.</p>
<p>No further details were available.</p>
</text>
